From 23df0c1d68eb126fced84e4a3ba1fc3be4e0d2a8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 26 Sep 2026 10:42:43 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add Cable TV mode (:tvmode-core, :tvmode) with minimal app
 hooks

A full-screen TV for channels scheduled by the Cable TV Jellyfin plugin.
The app plans tune-in from the cached schedule and the server clock,
direct-plays the airing file clipped to its slot at the right offset,
and queues the next items so they preload. Static covers buffering and
filler.

- :tvmode-core (plain Kotlin, unit tested): API models and client,
  ServerClock, ScheduleCache, TuneInPlanner, ChannelNavigator and guide
  grouping.
- :tvmode (Android): CableTvScreen (player surface, static overlay,
  channel banner with number entry, guide overlay, remote keys),
  CableTvViewModel, and the TvModeHost interface.
- App hooks: WholphinTvModeHost with its Hilt binding, Destination.CableTv,
  and a nav drawer item shown only when the server runs the plugin.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
